<title>UK: IBCA rates City of New York dlr FRN L-term A.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates City of New York dlr FRN L-term A.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency, said on Tuesday it had assigned a long-term A rating to the City of New York's 75 million dollar floating rate euronotes due 1998-2002.</p>
<p>IBCA said in June it had assigned an A rating to the senior unsecured debt of the City of New York. &quot;This rating is on that basis,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
